WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Just too many bottles

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
I want to look after the store, receive guests, and manage the restaurant.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,600
I really don’t have time for these chores

4
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,660
How important do I think it is?

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:08,860
This job is all on me

6
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:11,260
Bring the bottle. I'll install the system now.

7
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:13,260
Place an order for 200 clean empty water bottles

8
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:16,260
The order is successfully placed and 17 points will be deducted from Sister Wang.

9
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:18,260
There are 200 bottles here. Thank you for your hard work.

10
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,460
Just pretend, I'll treat you to some fruit. No, no, no.

11
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:22,260
I'm blowing on the air conditioner here and watching TV

12
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,660
Do some work and feel at ease mentally

13
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,860
Not tired at all

14
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:28,770
I'll put it in the refrigerator for you. No, no, no.

15
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:29,770
Boss, you are busy with your business

16
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:30,970
I'm familiar with this aspect of life

17
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,570
I used to work as a salesperson in a supermarket

18
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:33,970
Do these jobs every day

19
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:34,970
Very skilled

20
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:36,570
Well, thank you for your hard work, Sister Wang.

21
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:37,770
The high temperature has arrived

22
00:00:37,770 --> 00:00:39,370
Opportunity to really make some money

23
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:40,370
finally arrived
